 *
 * System-PM constraint layer: mark which SoC power states cut power to the
 * LPADC. When the driver holds a conversion lock, the PM policy must not pick
 * one of these states. Layered on top of app.overlay for the system phase.
 *
 * On MCXN947 the ADC analog block loses power in powerdown/deeppowerdown; sleep
 * and deepsleep retain it. Adjust per real project characterization.
 */

&lpadc0 {
	zephyr,disabling-power-states = <&powerdown &deeppowerdown>;
};
